7.6 MODEL RETRAINING SCHEDULE

1. Topic Detection / Classification
   Frequency: Monthly
   Trigger: Significant change in user question categories

2. Churn Score Model
   Frequency: Weekly
   Trigger: Changes in user engagement and churn patterns

3. News Sentiment Model
   Frequency: Weekly
   Trigger: Changes in news and language patterns

4. RAG Embedding Model
   Frequency: Monthly
   Trigger: Significant knowledge-base updates

5. Portfolio / Financial Insight Model
   Frequency: Monthly
   Trigger: Significant changes in financial data and insight requirements

Before deployment of every retrained model:

- Compare new metrics with previous version
- Register the new version in MLflow
- Run shadow deployment
- Monitor anomalous outputs
- Roll back if anomaly rate exceeds 5%
- Send retraining notification to Slack